    `2026-11-23T12-02-15Z-phase`);
  - the delegate's F3 is REPLACED by T1 (`inputs#I2`): F3 and F7 cannot both hold at HEAD, and test-plan
    decision/single-writer-state-files decides;
  - the overseer's technical answers T1 · T4 · T5 · T6 ★ (`inputs#I2`); T2 and T3 pending W1 and W2;
  - the operator's R2 answers (`inputs#I3`): ONE live `claude` start, no spare; workspace 1 free.

- **The operator's own W1–W3, each arm (a)** (`inputs#I4`, three Boundary widenings):
